    {
      "id": "librarian-title",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 20,
      "y": -200,
      "width": 3380,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "# Current Activation Paths: Present-Day UI, MCP, Broker & Staging Flow (d9435e1)\n**Symptom:** MCP agents hit contribute caps, zero folder MCP tools, curate process_approved refusals, 150s Ask waits (F-03), F-09 form wipes, and silently discarded workflow results (app.js:8472).\n**Root cause:** Document verified present-day UI, MCP, Broker, Staging, and Applications behaviour separately from proposed to-be envelopes and preserved historical DataManagement traces.\nLanes are actors; red arrows are extensions (numbered); red ends are ways the use case ends without success; orange cards call another use case. Generated from `librarian-current-activation.spec.yaml`."
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-s",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 140,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 70,
      "text": "● start",
      "color": "4"
    },
